sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch13-07> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-07--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-07--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch13-07: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.33" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.333"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "needs-new-data" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.63"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The claim is that attachment to the bony core can be the chief cause of curvature, and that this cause imitates unequal growth. Public scans can show that core and sheath differ in curvature, which is consistent with sheath-level shaping, but they contain neither adhesion nor deposition rates. Because the two mechanisms are defined to yield the same curve, a discriminating test needs developmental measurements that have not been archived." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Measure local attachment or resistance between sheath and core around the growing base, and compare that map with differential keratin deposition and with the resulting curvature. Adhesion would be implicated where curvature matches a measured retardation field in the absence of a matching deposition difference; shape identity of the two mechanisms cannot decide which one acted." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Thompson notes that adhesion and unequal growth produce the same spiral, so finished shape does not identify the cause.", "No open dataset maps adhesion, membrane attachment, or side-specific retardation during horn growth." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch13-07--grok--dataset-1> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-07--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch13-07 by Grok 4.7: 0.48" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.48"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-07--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch13-07> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch13-07--grok--operationalizability> .
